{
  "id": "move-track",
  "title": {
    "zh_cn": "移动轨道",
    "en_us": "MoveTrack"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh_cn": "在一段时间内把一段轨道改到一个目标状态，之后永久保持该状态",
    "en_us": "Animate a section of the track to a target state over time, then keep it permanently"
  },
  "zoom": 3.4,
  "spawnStagger": 0.18,
  "target": {
    "type": "event",
    "event": "MoveTrack"
  },
  "tiles": [
    { "angle": 0, "style": 0 },
    { "angle": 0, "style": 0 },
    { "angle": 0, "style": 0 },
    { "angle": 0, "style": 0 },
    { "angle": 0, "style": 0 },
    { "angle": 90, "style": 1 },
    { "angle": 0, "style": 0 },
    { "angle": 0, "style": 0 }
  ],
  "decos": [],
  "chapters": [
    {
      "floor": 0,
      "text": {
        "zh_cn": "<b>第 1 章 · 概览</b>\n{MoveTrack} 在一段 {duration} 内把范围内的 {tile} 平滑过渡到目标状态，\n结束后 <b>永久保持</b> 那个状态，<b>不会自动回原</b>。\n要恢复原状，需再发一个 {MoveTrack} 把值设回去。",
        "en_us": "<b>Chapter 1 · Overview</b>\n{MoveTrack} smoothly transitions a {range} of {tile}s to a target state over {duration},\nthen <b>keeps that state permanently</b> — it does <b>not</b> auto-restore.\nTo restore, send another {MoveTrack} with values set back to the original."
      },
      "notes": [
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "永久保持", "en_us": "stays" }, "tile": 2, "textX": 1.6, "textY": 0.9, "targetX": 0.4, "targetY": 0.3, "color": "#FFD24A" }
      ],
      "logic": [
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.6 },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 1, "endTile": 4, "positionOffset": [0, 0.4], "scale": 70, "rotationOffset": 15, "duration": 0.8, "ease": "OutCubic" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 1.6 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "floor": 0,
      "text": {
        "zh_cn": "<b>第 2 章 · 范围</b>\n{MoveTrack} 只影响 {startTile} 到 {endTile} 之间的 {tile}（含两端）。\n{range} 之外的 {tile} 完全不动。",
        "en_us": "<b>Chapter 2 · Range</b>\n{MoveTrack} only affects {tile}s from {startTile} to {endTile} (inclusive).\n{tile}s outside the {range} stay untouched."
      },
      "notes": [
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "{startTile}=1 · 从这里开始", "en_us": "{startTile}=1 · starts here" }, "tile": 1, "textX": 1.6, "textY": 0.85, "targetX": 0.4, "targetY": 0.3, "color": "#FFD24A" },
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "{endTile}=4 · 到这里结束", "en_us": "{endTile}=4 · ends here" }, "tile": 4, "textX": -1.5, "textY": 0.85, "targetX": -0.4, "targetY": 0.3, "color": "#FFD24A" },
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "范围外 · 不动", "en_us": "outside · still" }, "tile": 0, "textX": 0, "textY": 1.1, "targetX": 0, "targetY": 0.35, "color": "#90A4AE" }
      ],
      "logic": [
        { "eventType": "RecolorTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 1, "endTile": 4, "trackColor": "#FFD24A", "duration": 0.5, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 1, "endTile": 4, "positionOffset": [0, 0.4], "duration": 0.9, "ease": "OutCubic" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 1.6 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "floor": 0,
      "text": {
        "zh_cn": "<b>第 3 章 · {positionOffset}（位置偏移）</b>\nx 沿轨道方向，y 垂直轨道。\n偏移相对 {tile} 的<b>原始位置</b>叠加，<b>永久保持</b>。\n要恢复：再发一个 {MoveTrack}，把 {positionOffset} 设为 [0, 0]。",
        "en_us": "<b>Chapter 3 · {positionOffset}</b>\nx is along the track, y is perpendicular.\nThe offset is added on top of each {tile}'s <b>original position</b>, kept <b>permanently</b>.\nTo restore: send another {MoveTrack} with {positionOffset} = [0, 0]."
      },
      "notes": [
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "x 方向：向右", "en_us": "x axis: rightward" }, "tile": 2, "textX": 1.4, "textY": 0.7, "targetX": 0.4, "targetY": 0.25, "color": "#4FC3F7" },
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "y 方向：向上", "en_us": "y axis: upward" }, "tile": 6, "textX": 0, "textY": 1.4, "targetX": 0, "targetY": 0.4, "color": "#4FC3F7" }
      ],
      "logic": [
        { "eventType": "RecolorTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "trackColor": "#4FC3F7", "duration": 0.5, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 3, "positionOffset": [0.6, 0], "duration": 0.9, "ease": "OutCubic" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 4, "endTile": 7, "positionOffset": [0, 0.6], "duration": 0.9, "ease": "OutCubic" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.4 },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 3, "positionOffset": [0, 0], "duration": 0.8, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 4, "endTile": 7, "positionOffset": [0, 0], "duration": 0.8, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.6 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "floor": 0,
      "text": {
        "zh_cn": "<b>第 4 章 · {rotationOffset}（角度偏移）</b>\n每块 {tile} 相对自己<b>原始角度</b>额外转多少度。\n正数顺时针，负数逆时针；<b>永久保持</b>，不会自动回正。",
        "en_us": "<b>Chapter 4 · {rotationOffset}</b>\nEach {tile} rotates by an extra angle relative to its <b>original angle</b>.\nPositive = clockwise, negative = counter-clockwise. Kept <b>permanently</b>."
      },
      "notes": [
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "{rotationOffset}=20°", "en_us": "{rotationOffset}=20°" }, "tile": 2, "textX": 1.4, "textY": 0.7, "targetX": 0.4, "targetY": 0.25, "color": "#CE93D8" },
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "{rotationOffset}=-20°", "en_us": "{rotationOffset}=-20°" }, "tile": 6, "textX": -1.4, "textY": 0.7, "targetX": -0.4, "targetY": 0.25, "color": "#CE93D8" }
      ],
      "logic": [
        { "eventType": "RecolorTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "trackColor": "#CE93D8", "duration": 0.5, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 3, "rotationOffset": 20, "duration": 1.0, "ease": "OutBack" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 4, "endTile": 7, "rotationOffset": -20, "duration": 1.0, "ease": "OutBack" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.4 },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 3, "rotationOffset": 0, "duration": 0.9, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 4, "endTile": 7, "rotationOffset": 0, "duration": 0.9, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.5 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "floor": 0,
      "text": {
        "zh_cn": "<b>第 5 章 · {scale}（缩放）</b>\n{scale} 是<b>绝对目标值</b>，0~100。\n100 = 原大小，50 = 一半，0 = 缩成一个点。\n要恢复：再发一个 {MoveTrack}，把 {scale} 设为 100。",
        "en_us": "<b>Chapter 5 · {scale}</b>\n{scale} is an <b>absolute target</b> in 0~100.\n100 = original, 50 = half, 0 = a single point.\nTo restore: send another {MoveTrack} with {scale} = 100."
      },
      "notes": [
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "{scale}=60 · 缩到 60%", "en_us": "{scale}=60 · 60%" }, "tile": 2, "textX": 1.4, "textY": 0.7, "targetX": 0.4, "targetY": 0.25, "color": "#81C784" }
      ],
      "logic": [
        { "eventType": "RecolorTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "trackColor": "#81C784", "duration": 0.5, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "scale": 60, "duration": 0.9, "ease": "OutCubic" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.4 },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "scale": 100, "duration": 0.9, "ease": "OutBack" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.6 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "floor": 0,
      "text": {
        "zh_cn": "<b>第 6 章 · {opacity}（不透明度）</b>\n{opacity} 是<b>绝对目标值</b>，0~100。\n0 = 完全透明，100 = 不透明。\n要恢复：再发一个 {MoveTrack}，把 {opacity} 设为 100。",
        "en_us": "<b>Chapter 6 · {opacity}</b>\n{opacity} is an <b>absolute target</b> in 0~100.\n0 = invisible, 100 = opaque.\nTo restore: send another {MoveTrack} with {opacity} = 100."
      },
      "notes": [
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "{opacity}=20 · 几乎看不见", "en_us": "{opacity}=20 · nearly invisible" }, "tile": 2, "textX": 1.4, "textY": 0.7, "targetX": 0.4, "targetY": 0.25, "color": "#FF8A80" }
      ],
      "logic": [
        { "eventType": "RecolorTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "trackColor": "#FF8A80", "duration": 0.5, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "opacity": 20, "duration": 0.9, "ease": "OutCubic" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.4 },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "opacity": 100, "duration": 0.9, "ease": "InCubic" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.6 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "floor": 0,
      "text": {
        "zh_cn": "<b>第 7 章 · {gapLength}（跳格）</b>\n{gapLength}=0：范围内每块都动。\n{gapLength}=1：只动第 0、2、4、6 块（每隔一块）。\n{gapLength}=2：只动第 0、3、6 块。\n跳格只决定哪些 {tile} 受到本次 {MoveTrack} 影响，与永久保持无关。",
        "en_us": "<b>Chapter 7 · {gapLength}</b>\n{gapLength}=0: every {tile} in {range} moves.\n{gapLength}=1: tiles 0, 2, 4, 6 move (every other).\n{gapLength}=2: tiles 0, 3, 6 move.\n{gapLength} only picks which {tile}s this {MoveTrack} touches — it does not affect the permanent state."
      },
      "notes": [
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "{gapLength}=1\n只动偶数 {tile}", "en_us": "{gapLength}=1\nonly even {tile}s" }, "tile": 4, "textX": 0, "textY": 1.05, "targetX": 0, "targetY": 0.3, "color": "#B39DDB" }
      ],
      "logic": [
        { "eventType": "RecolorTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "trackColor": "#B39DDB", "duration": 0.5, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "gapLength": 1, "positionOffset": [0, 0.5], "duration": 0.9, "ease": "OutCubic" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.4 },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "gapLength": 1, "positionOffset": [0, 0], "duration": 0.9, "ease": "InCubic" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.6 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "floor": 0,
      "text": {
        "zh_cn": "<b>第 8 章 · {ease}（缓动）与 {duration}（时长）</b>\n{duration} 决定从当前状态过渡到目标状态要多少秒。\n{ease} 决定这段过渡的曲线：\n· {OutBack}：先冲过头再回弹\n· {OutBounce}：像球落地一样弹跳\n· {linear}：匀速\n同样的 {positionOffset}，{ease} 不同手感完全不同。\n<b>注意：{ease} 只影响过渡，不影响最终状态</b>。",
        "en_us": "<b>Chapter 8 · {ease} & {duration}</b>\n{duration} sets how long the transition takes.\n{ease} sets the motion curve:\n· {OutBack}: overshoot, then spring back\n· {OutBounce}: bounces like a falling ball\n· {linear}: constant speed\nThe same {positionOffset} feels different with different {ease}.\n<b>Note: {ease} affects the transition only, not the final state.</b>"
      },
      "notes": [
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "{OutBack}", "en_us": "{OutBack}" }, "tile": 1, "textX": 1.5, "textY": 0.7, "targetX": 0.4, "targetY": 0.25, "color": "#F48FB1" },
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "{OutBounce}", "en_us": "{OutBounce}" }, "tile": 4, "textX": -1.5, "textY": 0.7, "targetX": -0.4, "targetY": 0.25, "color": "#F48FB1" }
      ],
      "logic": [
        { "eventType": "RecolorTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "trackColor": "#F48FB1", "duration": 0.5, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 3, "positionOffset": [0, 0.6], "duration": 1.0, "ease": "OutBack" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 4, "endTile": 7, "positionOffset": [0, 0.6], "duration": 1.0, "ease": "OutBounce" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.4 },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 3, "positionOffset": [0, 0], "duration": 1.0, "ease": "InCubic" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 4, "endTile": 7, "positionOffset": [0, 0], "duration": 1.0, "ease": "InCubic" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.5 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "floor": 0,
      "text": {
        "zh_cn": "<b>第 9 章 · 多次调用与覆盖</b>\n因为 {MoveTrack} 是永久状态，对同一 {tile} 再发一次 {MoveTrack} 会：\n· 取消上一次过渡（如果还在进行）\n· 启动新一次过渡到新目标\n· 完成后保持<b>新</b>目标\n也就是说：<b>后一次覆盖前一次的最终值</b>，而不是撤销。",
        "en_us": "<b>Chapter 9 · Multiple calls & override</b>\nSince {MoveTrack} is a permanent state, sending another {MoveTrack} on the same {tile} will:\n· cancel the previous transition (if still in progress)\n· start a new transition to the new target\n· keep the <b>new</b> target afterwards\nIn short: the later call <b>overrides</b> the previous final value, it does not undo it."
      },
      "notes": [
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "第 1 次：y+0.6", "en_us": "1st: y+0.6" }, "tile": 2, "textX": 1.4, "textY": 0.7, "targetX": 0.4, "targetY": 0.25, "color": "#90CAF9" },
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "第 2 次：y-0.3", "en_us": "2nd: y-0.3" }, "tile": 2, "textX": 1.4, "textY": 1.2, "targetX": 0.4, "targetY": 0.25, "color": "#A5D6A7" },
        { "text": { "zh_cn": "最终：y=-0.3", "en_us": "final: y=-0.3" }, "tile": 2, "textX": 1.4, "textY": 1.7, "targetX": 0.4, "targetY": 0.25, "color": "#FFD24A" }
      ],
      "logic": [
        { "eventType": "RecolorTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 7, "trackColor": "#90CAF9", "duration": 0.4, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 3, "positionOffset": [0, 0.6], "duration": 1.2, "ease": "OutBack" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.5 },
        { "eventType": "RecolorTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 3, "trackColor": "#A5D6A7", "duration": 0.3, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "eventType": "MoveTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 3, "positionOffset": [0, -0.3], "duration": 1.0, "ease": "OutCubic" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.5 },
        { "eventType": "RecolorTrack", "floor": 0, "startTile": 0, "endTile": 3, "trackColor": "#FFD24A", "duration": 0.3, "ease": "InOutQuad" },
        { "cmd": "Wait", "floor": 0, "duration": 0.6 }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
